! STEOM-DLPNO-CCSD def2-SVP def2-SVP/C def2/J RIJCOSX TightSCF TightPNO
# 73-atom model (chr + His148 + full Tyr203), def2-SVP. Comparable to the 44-atom SVP
# (500.9 nm) -> isolates the His148 + full-Tyr203 effect. NRoots 3 (only need bright state 1)
# + maxcore 3000 for memory margin. SVP/TightPNO PNO space is far smaller than TZVP, so it fits.
%maxcore 3000
%pal nprocs 8 end
%pointcharges "field_big.pc"
%mdci
  NRoots 3
  DoRootWise true
  DoStoreSTEOM true
  AddL2Term True
  TCutPNOSingles 1e-12
  NDav 400
  MaxIter 200
end
* xyzfile -1 1 geom_big.xyz
